# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout across all platforms. Keeps Biome's
# formatter consistent on Windows/macOS/Linux (Git-for-Windows autocrlf would
# otherwise check out CRLF and fail `biome check`), and guarantees the POSIX
# bash hooks (*.sh) are never written with CRLF, which would break them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
